            "text": "```python\nimport numpy as np\n\n\ndef main():\n    X = np.load(\"vectors.npy\", mmap_mode=\"r\")\n    N = X.shape[0]\n\n    # Precompute squared L2 norms for each vector\n    sq = np.empty(N, dtype=np.float32)\n    for i in range(0, N, 1000):\n        chunk = X[i : i + 1000]\n        sq[i : i + 1000] = np.einsum(\"ij,ij->i\", chunk, chunk)\n\n    total_dist = 0.0\n    chunk_size = 500\n\n    for i in range(0, N, chunk_size):\n        Xi = X[i : i + chunk_size]\n        # Gram matrix chunk: shape (chunk_size, N)\n        G = np.dot(Xi, X.T)\n\n        # Compute squared distances in-place to minimize memory usage\n        G *= -2.0\n        G += sq[i : i + chunk_size, None]\n        G += sq[None, :]\n\n        np.maximum(G, 0.0, out=G)\n        np.sqrt(G, out=G)\n\n        total_dist += float(G.sum(dtype=np.float64))\n\n    print(f\"TOTAL:{total_dist}\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```",
